WEBVTT

00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:29.560
This way.

00:00:34.220 --> 00:00:35.260
Daddy!

00:00:36.160 --> 00:00:36.890
Hibiki?

00:00:37.230 --> 00:00:38.390
Thank goodness!

00:00:39.140 --> 00:00:41.780
Don't wander off like that.

00:00:42.370 --> 00:00:43.980
I'm sorry.

00:00:44.690 --> 00:00:47.090
Thank you for bringing Hibiki back.

00:00:47.600 --> 00:00:48.840
Thanks!

00:00:50.970 --> 00:00:53.280
No need to thank me.

00:00:54.070 --> 00:00:55.180
Instead...

00:02:29.180 --> 00:02:32.390
It's so exciting to come to
a theme park with everyone!

00:02:32.390 --> 00:02:33.240
It is!

00:02:34.510 --> 00:02:38.630
Inoue, do you not like theme parks?

00:02:38.960 --> 00:02:42.350
Well, I wouldn't say that, exactly...

00:02:42.350 --> 00:02:44.930
Oh, right, there's a haunted house here.

00:02:44.930 --> 00:02:46.960
After all you've been through with Amami,

00:02:46.960 --> 00:02:48.840
you're still scared of the fake stuff?

00:02:48.840 --> 00:02:50.100
Shut up!

00:02:53.170 --> 00:02:54.530
Theme park!

00:02:54.530 --> 00:02:56.860
She's really psyched.

00:02:56.860 --> 00:02:58.790
It looks so fun!

00:03:01.140 --> 00:03:02.810
Huh? Um...

00:03:02.810 --> 00:03:05.160
Shh. Don't make eye contact.

00:03:05.160 --> 00:03:06.370
Hey!

00:03:06.370 --> 00:03:09.310
You got us the tickets, right, Amami?

00:03:09.310 --> 00:03:10.630
Oh, yes.

00:03:11.040 --> 00:03:13.380
Someone my dad works with gave them to us.

00:03:13.810 --> 00:03:14.200
He told me this theme park
holds memories for us.

00:03:14.200 --> 00:03:16.360
Hello!
He told me this theme park
holds memories for us.

00:03:16.360 --> 00:03:17.630
Hello!

00:03:17.630 --> 00:03:19.050
Knock it off!

00:03:20.000 --> 00:03:21.050
Her patience ran out!

00:03:21.050 --> 00:03:22.800
Why are you here, Yamada's brother?!

00:03:23.080 --> 00:03:25.760
Oh, I had nothing to do, so I tagged along.

00:03:25.760 --> 00:03:27.180
No one invited you!

00:03:27.180 --> 00:03:29.910
Stuff like that is what
makes my brother so great!

00:03:29.910 --> 00:03:31.190
That wasn't a compliment!

00:03:31.620 --> 00:03:33.190
By the way, everyone.

00:03:34.690 --> 00:03:36.830
Why aren't you more lightly dressed?

00:03:36.830 --> 00:03:38.990
How can you say that so casually?!

00:03:39.260 --> 00:03:41.860
But it's summer!
And you're high school girls!

00:03:42.240 --> 00:03:45.870
You've gotta do the things
you shouldn't while you're still...

00:03:45.870 --> 00:03:46.790
young!

00:03:49.040 --> 00:03:52.000
She's about to do something she shouldn't!

00:03:52.530 --> 00:03:54.040
Now, now, now...

00:03:54.360 --> 00:03:56.690
Let's all just have fun here together.

00:03:57.610 --> 00:04:01.550
Yeah, sure. We don't really have
time to waste on him, anyway.

00:04:02.470 --> 00:04:06.020
We did invite an actual special guest, after all.

00:04:06.760 --> 00:04:08.730
That's right. Look!

00:04:09.480 --> 00:04:11.010
Ta-da!

00:04:11.010 --> 00:04:12.850
I <i>did</i> agree to do this...

00:04:13.560 --> 00:04:14.730
Bound Soul?

00:04:15.630 --> 00:04:18.820
Well, it's just an audio and video feed, though.

00:04:18.820 --> 00:04:20.560
And while we were at it,

00:04:20.560 --> 00:04:23.490
we asked the roll-call samurai
and the gal ghost to help.

00:04:23.890 --> 00:04:26.060
I think quite a few of them are here.

00:04:26.060 --> 00:04:27.240
Huh?

00:04:29.290 --> 00:04:30.290
Greetings.

00:04:33.260 --> 00:04:34.280
Hey, girlie.

00:04:34.280 --> 00:04:36.970
Why didn't you tell me?

00:04:36.970 --> 00:04:40.750
Because knowing you, you'd just
stress out and make a fuss over

00:04:40.750 --> 00:04:42.200
both the living and the dead.

00:04:42.200 --> 00:04:44.050
It was just a little surprise.

00:04:44.320 --> 00:04:47.360
Someone's a lot more
surprised than you, though.

00:04:47.360 --> 00:04:50.660
Don't worry! They're all people you know...

00:04:50.660 --> 00:04:52.560
That's not the problem!

00:04:57.600 --> 00:04:59.110
Blank.

00:04:59.810 --> 00:05:04.130
Yoshida Yoshiki has three days until the deadline
for his self-written comic manuscript...

00:05:04.130 --> 00:05:06.020
Yet he's plagued with writer's block.

00:05:06.870 --> 00:05:09.890
The white page seems to expand into eternity

00:05:09.890 --> 00:05:12.870
as the blinding sunlight reflects off its surface...

00:05:15.260 --> 00:05:16.330
Summer is here!

00:05:20.630 --> 00:05:25.320
This so-called theme park is quite a strange place.

00:05:25.960 --> 00:05:28.910
What's the matter? You spooked?

00:05:28.910 --> 00:05:31.020
M-Most assuredly not!

00:05:31.410 --> 00:05:34.770
There's nothing to worry about. This is a fun place.

00:05:34.770 --> 00:05:37.610
The roll-call samurai's totally spooked.

00:05:37.610 --> 00:05:41.110
You think he'll freak out in the haunted house,
even though he's a ghost?

00:05:42.950 --> 00:05:45.110
Barbarian cavalry!

00:05:45.400 --> 00:05:46.950
<i>That's</i> what he's scared of?

00:05:46.950 --> 00:05:48.590
You dork!

00:05:49.710 --> 00:05:51.290
They're just machines.

00:05:51.670 --> 00:05:54.600
You're so behind the times, samurai.

00:05:56.960 --> 00:06:00.100
What is this?! That's how they work now?!

00:06:00.100 --> 00:06:01.510
Quick, put in some money!

00:06:01.510 --> 00:06:02.710
Um, okay...

00:06:03.530 --> 00:06:05.200
Look at all the options!

00:06:05.200 --> 00:06:06.670
This is so cool!

00:06:06.670 --> 00:06:08.220
One more, one more!

00:06:08.730 --> 00:06:10.970
They're mass-producing ghost stickers?!

00:06:11.700 --> 00:06:14.760
Looks like you're the one
who's behind the times now!

00:06:14.760 --> 00:06:16.830
Get outta the shot!

00:06:19.480 --> 00:06:21.260
Hey, wanna ride that?

00:06:21.260 --> 00:06:22.730
Yeah!

00:06:25.690 --> 00:06:26.740
Oh, this is—

00:06:26.740 --> 00:06:27.950
Don't say it.

00:06:27.950 --> 00:06:30.310
I get it! A ghost is riding with you!

00:06:30.310 --> 00:06:32.150
I said not to say it!

00:06:32.150 --> 00:06:35.120
If you can't deal with this much,
how will you handle <i>that</i>?

00:06:40.470 --> 00:06:43.170
Wow! Everyone's riding with us?

00:06:46.180 --> 00:06:50.180
What a weirdo! She's screaming
before the ride's even started!

00:06:57.140 --> 00:06:59.160
That was fun!

00:06:59.160 --> 00:07:01.390
It made me a little dizzy, though.

00:07:03.670 --> 00:07:06.400
Someone untangle me!

00:07:12.990 --> 00:07:18.000
If someone lifts their skirt here,
I'll get a 360-degree panty shot!

00:07:21.210 --> 00:07:22.260
Whoops...

00:07:23.740 --> 00:07:25.330
Dead end?

00:07:28.320 --> 00:07:28.880
Hello?

00:07:28.880 --> 00:07:30.380
My name is Mary.

00:07:30.700 --> 00:07:34.930
I've got a 360-degree view of you in here.

00:07:40.590 --> 00:07:43.460
Lady Amami's riding with the Bound Soul...

00:07:45.350 --> 00:07:47.710
Should I tilt it downward some more?

00:07:47.710 --> 00:07:51.470
No, this is fine. I can see the view well.

00:07:53.450 --> 00:07:58.470
Still, you do have some unusual friends,
inviting ghosts to a theme park.

00:07:59.400 --> 00:08:02.060
Yes. They really surprised me.

00:08:03.100 --> 00:08:05.190
Do you come here often?

00:08:06.310 --> 00:08:10.260
Apparently, I did when I was a little girl,

00:08:10.260 --> 00:08:13.100
but I don't really remember it.

00:08:13.700 --> 00:08:15.100
I see.

00:08:15.770 --> 00:08:19.160
Oh, right. She said she'd come along, too.

00:08:19.160 --> 00:08:21.210
What? Who?

00:08:30.100 --> 00:08:32.070
It sounded fun, so here I am.

00:08:32.690 --> 00:08:34.300
I'm glad to have you!

00:08:37.240 --> 00:08:40.000
It's finally time for the haunted house!

00:08:40.740 --> 00:08:42.520
Let's make sure we're all set.

00:08:42.520 --> 00:08:44.770
Tissues for Inoue, check!

00:08:44.770 --> 00:08:46.550
Tissues, check!

00:08:46.550 --> 00:08:49.750
Protective charms, check!

00:08:49.750 --> 00:08:50.710
Um...

00:08:50.710 --> 00:08:52.720
Then let's head in!

00:08:54.390 --> 00:08:58.040
I wonder what kinds of ghosts will pop out.

00:08:58.040 --> 00:09:00.520
Stop scaring me...

00:09:00.520 --> 00:09:03.110
With a big group like this, though...

00:09:03.110 --> 00:09:05.360
It might not be that scary.

00:09:12.090 --> 00:09:13.400
Oh, come on...

00:09:13.400 --> 00:09:14.760
That was scarier than any ghost.

00:09:14.760 --> 00:09:17.160
Our true enemy is one of our own.

00:09:17.160 --> 00:09:20.500
You scare way too easily, Inoue.

00:09:20.500 --> 00:09:22.160
I wanna go home...

00:09:24.530 --> 00:09:27.740
Wow, they did a good job with this.

00:09:30.360 --> 00:09:34.260
To spend your entire existence sticking
your neck out and scaring people...

00:09:40.390 --> 00:09:41.930
Noritama?

00:09:43.580 --> 00:09:44.960
Six...

00:09:45.640 --> 00:09:46.810
Seven...

00:09:47.210 --> 00:09:50.320
Eight... Nine...

00:09:50.700 --> 00:09:53.170
I'm missing one!

00:09:55.320 --> 00:09:56.820
Um, here!

00:09:56.820 --> 00:09:59.200
It's an unbreakable plate for lunch boxes.

00:09:59.470 --> 00:10:00.710
Please take it!

00:10:00.710 --> 00:10:02.200
She fixed the problem!

00:10:02.570 --> 00:10:05.210
Why are you sticking right behind me?

00:10:05.500 --> 00:10:08.210
Hey, we're in a haunted house, after all.

00:10:12.560 --> 00:10:13.770
Hey, she looks like you!

00:10:13.770 --> 00:10:14.880
She does not.

00:10:18.310 --> 00:10:19.890
It's the Flame-Haired Messiah!

00:10:19.890 --> 00:10:22.510
Look, look, look!

00:10:22.510 --> 00:10:24.640
I don't look like that, you idiot!

00:10:31.430 --> 00:10:35.400
Well, this is the last room
of the haunted house, but...

00:10:35.400 --> 00:10:38.410
The thing that's surprised me most of all so far is...

00:10:44.750 --> 00:10:49.170
Amami only getting scared by the fake ghosts.

00:10:52.910 --> 00:10:55.820
Man, what a blast!

00:10:55.820 --> 00:10:56.280
We're just getting started, bro!

00:10:56.280 --> 00:10:57.950
By the way, Amami, you said this
place held memories for you.

00:10:57.950 --> 00:10:58.950
Yep! We totally are!

00:10:58.950 --> 00:10:59.890
Where to next?

00:10:59.890 --> 00:11:01.080
Somewhere really explosive!

00:11:01.080 --> 00:11:02.420
Oh, right.

00:11:02.420 --> 00:11:04.950
I don't remember it too well myself,

00:11:04.950 --> 00:11:09.190
but I got lost here when I was little, and...

00:11:11.190 --> 00:11:12.920
Oh, is he lost?

00:11:12.920 --> 00:11:14.530
That was timely.

00:11:16.820 --> 00:11:18.200
Okay!

00:11:18.200 --> 00:11:21.070
I'll go find a staff member!

00:11:21.400 --> 00:11:24.850
You can stay here and play with us while we wait.

00:11:27.830 --> 00:11:30.830
Have we met before?

00:11:33.680 --> 00:11:36.210
Yes... Yes, I understand.

00:11:36.610 --> 00:11:40.040
We've found the parents. I'll take him there now.

00:11:40.040 --> 00:11:41.620
That's great.

00:11:43.760 --> 00:11:46.450
Thanks for coming back.

00:11:47.500 --> 00:11:50.960
He must've felt so helpless,
being lost and all alone.

00:11:50.960 --> 00:11:52.660
All alone?

00:11:52.660 --> 00:11:54.020
What is it?

00:11:58.880 --> 00:12:00.400
Thank you!

00:12:03.460 --> 00:12:05.170
No need to thank me.

00:12:05.710 --> 00:12:06.910
Instead...

00:12:07.450 --> 00:12:10.660
Come back with your friends and play with me.

00:12:14.510 --> 00:12:16.270
Seriously, what is it?

00:12:16.270 --> 00:12:18.450
Oh, it's nothing.

00:12:24.420 --> 00:12:28.180
<i>I came back with my friends to play.</i>

00:12:30.180 --> 00:12:32.440
Let the panda take your picture!

00:12:32.880 --> 00:12:34.440
Everyone line up!

00:12:34.440 --> 00:12:38.540
Roll-call Samurai, let Gal come in closer!

00:12:38.540 --> 00:12:40.900
Everyone squeeze towards the middle.

00:12:40.900 --> 00:12:44.070
And Hanako's getting covered up.

00:12:44.070 --> 00:12:46.390
Ogawa, if you'll kneel down...

00:12:46.390 --> 00:12:47.200
Huh?

00:12:49.010 --> 00:12:49.800
Okay!

00:12:50.200 --> 00:12:52.190
We're all ready.

00:12:54.120 --> 00:12:56.210
P-P-Panda! I'm a panda!

00:12:57.010 --> 00:12:59.710
Everyone say, "Panda drank some water!"

00:12:59.710 --> 00:13:00.510
Click!

00:13:03.620 --> 00:13:05.410
Dad, I'm home.

00:13:05.410 --> 00:13:06.850
Welcome back, Hibiki.

00:13:06.850 --> 00:13:08.150
Good evening!

00:13:08.150 --> 00:13:09.720
Hello, everyone!

00:13:10.040 --> 00:13:12.720
Time for today's big climax!

00:13:12.720 --> 00:13:14.650
A sleepover at Amami's house!

00:13:16.990 --> 00:13:20.320
U-Um, the boys...

00:13:20.320 --> 00:13:21.800
Don't mind us.

00:13:22.520 --> 00:13:24.150
We'll sleep in the yard!

00:13:24.150 --> 00:13:27.450
Uh, going home isn't an option?

00:13:27.450 --> 00:13:29.120
Nope!

00:13:29.120 --> 00:13:32.790
How could I miss the chance
to have a summer sleepover

00:13:32.790 --> 00:13:35.000
with a bunch of young high school gir—

00:13:36.510 --> 00:13:38.460
Bro!

00:13:40.340 --> 00:13:42.010
Thanks for having us!

00:13:42.320 --> 00:13:44.040
You're welcome to stay over,

00:13:44.040 --> 00:13:45.840
but are you sure our house will do?

00:13:46.120 --> 00:13:47.580
Of course!

00:13:47.580 --> 00:13:49.430
Are you cool with this?

00:13:49.430 --> 00:13:52.530
Frankly, I think this place'll be
way scarier than a haunted house.

00:13:53.210 --> 00:13:58.860
O-Of course. Sleeping over at
a friend's house is perfectly normal.

00:13:59.370 --> 00:14:01.110
Inoue!

00:14:01.110 --> 00:14:04.860
Seriously, stop being so dramatic!

00:14:07.910 --> 00:14:09.910
Wanna do something?

00:14:09.910 --> 00:14:11.470
How about a word game?

00:14:11.470 --> 00:14:12.840
Sounds good!

00:14:12.840 --> 00:14:15.120
It... It does?

00:14:15.120 --> 00:14:17.790
Okay! I'll start then!

00:14:17.790 --> 00:14:18.720
Umbrella!

00:14:20.480 --> 00:14:21.400
Aquatic snail!

00:14:21.400 --> 00:14:22.950
Level Five.

00:14:22.950 --> 00:14:23.890
East Asian Law.

00:14:24.720 --> 00:14:25.780
Winking.

00:14:25.780 --> 00:14:27.010
Girls' Bathroom.

00:14:27.010 --> 00:14:28.070
Mt. Kilimanjaro.

00:14:28.070 --> 00:14:29.070
Oil Candle.

00:14:29.070 --> 00:14:31.350
Extremely late at night.

00:14:33.100 --> 00:14:36.710
This is our complete theme
park group, and then some.

00:14:44.990 --> 00:14:46.720
While I'm in here doing this,

00:14:46.720 --> 00:14:50.660
other students are probably out
enjoying their summer to the fullest.

00:14:50.660 --> 00:14:52.130
Like going to theme parks,

00:14:52.130 --> 00:14:56.250
and maybe even having sleepovers afterward?

00:14:56.550 --> 00:14:58.020
I'm so jealous...

00:14:58.500 --> 00:15:02.310
No, I swore to dedicate my youth to manga!

00:15:02.310 --> 00:15:07.010
I have to finish in time for the summer event
so the whole world can witness its greatness!

00:15:09.490 --> 00:15:11.090
I'll try for real next year.

00:15:12.040 --> 00:15:14.510
Um, everyone...

00:15:15.030 --> 00:15:17.980
What should we have for dinner?

00:15:17.980 --> 00:15:19.870
Oh, I'll help you cook!

00:15:19.870 --> 00:15:21.860
Me too.

00:15:22.650 --> 00:15:27.440
I know! Make Inoue's grandma's fried eggs!

00:15:28.540 --> 00:15:30.450
Don't decide for everyone!

00:15:34.080 --> 00:15:35.930
That was great!

00:15:35.930 --> 00:15:37.330
Sure was!

00:15:37.700 --> 00:15:42.180
I never thought I'd get to eat a dinner
made by beautiful high school girls.

00:15:42.180 --> 00:15:43.810
I'm deeply moved!

00:15:43.810 --> 00:15:45.960
Get back out in the yard!

00:15:46.240 --> 00:15:51.130
Actually, the gal ghost's mother
taught me the recipes for all of these.

00:15:51.130 --> 00:15:53.470
Wow, they're really delicious.

00:15:53.470 --> 00:15:56.290
Please, it was nothing.

00:15:56.290 --> 00:15:57.220
Cut it out!

00:15:57.220 --> 00:16:00.480
Your fried eggs were great, too, Inoue.

00:16:00.800 --> 00:16:03.440
I-It was really noffing thpethia—

00:16:03.440 --> 00:16:04.900
That came out totally wrong!

00:16:06.610 --> 00:16:09.190
Well, now that dinner's done,

00:16:09.190 --> 00:16:12.640
wanna go for another summer favorite
and light some fireworks?

00:16:13.620 --> 00:16:17.120
I brought my yukata! What about you all?

00:16:17.120 --> 00:16:19.010
Mine's ready!

00:16:19.010 --> 00:16:21.120
You told me to bring mine, so I did.

00:16:21.120 --> 00:16:22.600
Yeah, got mine.

00:16:22.600 --> 00:16:24.800
High school girls in yukatas?

00:16:24.800 --> 00:16:26.500
Hang on, let me get my camera—

00:16:26.500 --> 00:16:29.510
Forget the yard! Just go home!

00:17:35.250 --> 00:17:36.390
This one.

00:17:36.390 --> 00:17:37.530
No, this one!

00:17:58.410 --> 00:18:00.100
By the way...

00:18:00.100 --> 00:18:04.260
Don't the ghosts always come to
whoever's sleeping in the middle?

00:18:06.300 --> 00:18:08.020
Don't say stuff like that!

00:18:10.020 --> 00:18:12.590
Sheesh! Let's just go to sleep!

00:18:12.590 --> 00:18:14.030
Okay.

00:18:25.570 --> 00:18:30.500
<i>Until she said that, I'd forgotten
this place was packed with ghosts.</i>

00:18:34.130 --> 00:18:37.120
Honestly, don't scare me...

00:18:41.050 --> 00:18:42.560
Can't sleep?

00:18:47.700 --> 00:18:50.550
D-Don't worry about me.

00:18:50.550 --> 00:18:53.070
I'll get sleepy eventually.

00:19:21.720 --> 00:19:22.800
Um...

00:19:23.090 --> 00:19:25.060
Wh-What?

00:19:26.890 --> 00:19:28.650
My dad told me

00:19:29.340 --> 00:19:33.270
that when I was little, and I couldn't sleep,

00:19:33.270 --> 00:19:35.570
he would always hold my hand like this.

00:19:36.150 --> 00:19:37.210
Amami...

00:19:40.440 --> 00:19:41.570
I can't sleep like this.

00:19:41.860 --> 00:19:43.450
S-Sorry!

00:19:44.170 --> 00:19:46.440
I'm so nervous, my hands are shaking...

00:19:47.610 --> 00:19:49.750
What are you guys doing?

00:19:50.040 --> 00:19:52.170
Try counting sheep?

00:19:52.460 --> 00:19:54.100
Should I warm up some milk?

00:19:54.870 --> 00:19:55.810
Everyone?

00:19:55.810 --> 00:19:57.140
You're all awake?

00:19:57.600 --> 00:19:59.800
Stretching can also help.

00:19:59.800 --> 00:20:02.170
They say light exercise helps, too.

00:20:02.170 --> 00:20:04.850
Did you bring your wooden sword to bed?

00:20:05.160 --> 00:20:07.080
It's to protect myself from that idiot.

00:20:11.180 --> 00:20:13.560
How about a lullaby?

00:20:14.430 --> 00:20:18.190
Or have the ghosts scare her silly until she faints!

00:20:18.190 --> 00:20:19.510
A-Anything but that!

00:20:19.510 --> 00:20:21.090
Just kidding.

00:20:21.090 --> 00:20:24.440
Well, we can always pull an all-nighter together.

00:20:24.440 --> 00:20:25.880
We might have to.

00:20:25.880 --> 00:20:27.750
That could be fun, too.

00:20:28.270 --> 00:20:31.430
Thank you, everyone.

00:20:31.430 --> 00:20:33.750
What are you thanking us for?

00:20:33.750 --> 00:20:36.560
Yeah, she's the one who should be...

00:20:51.330 --> 00:20:52.850
Unbelievable.

00:20:52.850 --> 00:20:55.690
I was all set to stay up all night.

00:20:57.020 --> 00:20:58.490
Too bad.

00:21:08.860 --> 00:21:15.210
<i>I hope we'll all continue to spend our days
together, one by one, just like this.</i>

00:21:58.500 --> 00:22:00.740
I-I'm sorry, Inoue!

00:22:00.740 --> 00:22:03.450
I held your hand all night...

00:22:03.450 --> 00:22:05.020
What the heck? Darn it, now I'm blushing, too!

00:22:05.020 --> 00:22:06.220
Girl on girl?

00:22:06.220 --> 00:22:07.980
Aaaaaaaaw, yeah baby!
